## Interface: 120007, 120100
## Title: XIVEquip
## Notes: FFXIV-style 'Equip Recommended Gear' button using Pawn when available.
## Author: argument.null.ex@gmail.com (aka Code Ninja)
## Version: 2.0.0-dev.101
## SavedVariables: XIVEquip_Settings
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\XIVEquip\Assets\icon_blue_128
# Third-party addons reach XIVEquip:RegisterPolicy (PublicAPI/Policies.lua)
# via C_AddOns.GetAddOnLocalTable("XIVEquip") -- that call only returns the
# addon-local table when this is set. Without it, RegisterPolicy exists but
# is unreachable from outside XIVEquip's own files.
## AllowAddOnTableAccess: 1
